      "instance_name": "osha",
      "label": "Occupational Safety and Health Administration",
      "description": "OSHA is a U.S. federal agency responsible for ensuring safe and healthy working conditions by setting and enforcing standards and providing training, outreach, education, and assistance. The meme references OSHA sarcastically to imply that safety regulations are unnecessary or irrelevant in the depicted context, which is a racially charged and harmful stereotype.",
