      "label": "Hateful Meme Using Racial Stereotypes",
      "description": "The meme uses the visual of Black men in a rural setting to mock OSHA regulations, implying that such regulations are unnecessary in their environment. This is a clear example of a hateful meme that relies on racialized assumptions to justify or mock the perceived lack of safety in Black communities, which is a form of racial stereotyping and discrimination.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
