      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "distress",
      "label": "distressed emotion",
      "description": "The man on the left is tilting his head back and placing his hand on his neck, a gesture commonly associated with physical discomfort, pain, or distress. His facial expression, with eyes closed and mouth slightly open, reinforces this interpretation of suffering or unease.",
